# 统一行尾：仓库里一律 LF，避免 Windows 机器上反复出现「整个文件都改了」的噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：不要做任何行尾/编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdf binary

# 这些文本文件必须保持可读的文本属性，方便 diff
*.md text
*.js text
*.mjs text
*.json text
*.css text
*.html text
*.rs text
*.toml text
*.nsh text
*.ps1 text
*.py text
